{"text": "Suddenly the saddle slipped off and fell to the road, but Ichabod held on tightly to Gunpowders neck. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Seeing the church bridge ahead, he thought, If I could only reach that bridge, I would be safe. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He crossed it and looked back, expecting the rider to vanish in a flash of fire, as Brom had said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Instead, the rider stood up in his stirrups and threw his head straight at Ichabod. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It struck Ichabods head, and he fell into the dust while the dark rider rushed past like a whirlwind. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The next morning, Gunpowder was found eating grass at his masters gate, but there was no sign of Ichabod. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> By the brook, people found his hat, and close beside it lay a pumpkin broken into pieces. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Ichabod never returned, and years later an old farmer said he had become a judge in a faraway place. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Soon after, Brom married Katrina, and whenever the pumpkin was mentioned, he laughed in a knowing way. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the old wives of the valley still say that the Headless Horseman carried Ichabod away that night.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "u", "d", "d", "e", "n", "l", "y", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "d", "d", "l", "e", " ", "s", "l", "i", "p", "p", "e", "d", " ", "o", "f", "f", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "f", "e", "l", "l", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "r", "o", "a", "d", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "I", "c", "h", "a", "b", "o", "d", " ", "h", "e", "l", "d", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "i", "g", "h", "t", "l", "y", " ", "t", "o", " ", "G", "u", "n", "p", "o", "w", "d", "e", "r", "s", " ", "n", "e", "c", "k", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "e", "e", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "h", "u", "r", "c", "h", " ", "b", "r", "i", "d", "g", "e", " ", "a", "h", "